                                "example_id": "ac12eb96-649d-4ef9-8943-ccc9550526ba",
                                "sense_id": "38e01623-4325-3904-8044-d9b19653a350",
                                "text": "They saw him board, neatly running the small boat under the schooner's counter; they saw the foresheet eased off and the ship run up into the wind; then the foresail dropped and the wheel lashed so that she would stand so."
